  "processing": {
    "rgb": "Illustrated solid regions retain source RGB; exterior near-neutral shadow mattes are unpremultiplied against white. No redrawing or pixel resampling.",
    "alpha": "Near-white edge-connected backgrounds become transparent; enclosed white fills stay opaque. Exterior neutral shadows retain their source shape with derived alpha; tiny fringe noise below alpha 10 is discarded.",
    "encoding": "Lossless WebP, exact=True",
    "backgroundCaution": "Source sheets have opaque near-white mattes. Transparency and shadow alpha are derived approximations; very faint near-white shadow fringes are omitted. Colored edges may retain a subtle source matte at extreme zoom."
  },
